+
+## `bb.experimental_p6rPrompts`
+
+Synchronous server-owned string middleware and completed render observations. Registrations live on loaded plugin handles, ordered by lexical plugin ID then registration order, with duplicate names rejected per surface. `next()` keeps current text; `next(text)` continues with modified text once. ID, provenance, context and protected slot metadata stay fixed. Plugins receive recursive immutable copies. Templates expose original body/inputs; arbitrary replacement templates use pure Handlebars with `noEscape` and trimmed output.
