+## Prompt customization
+
+`bb.experimental_p6rPrompts` registers synchronous named middleware and observers,
+renders plugin-owned prose, and renders replacement Handlebars templates.
+Middleware may call `next()` or `next(text)` once; invalid customization falls
+back to the default text. Observations describe rendering, not provider delivery.
+Registrations are removed on disposal or plugin unload; generated artifacts and
+existing provider sessions retain their content until their normal refresh.
+See the Plugin Guide prompt surface for the request, protected-slot, ordering and
+fallback contracts.
